flowchart TB
  subgraph Clients[客户端与可信入口]
    WEB[Web / React + Vite]
    ELE[Electron 桌宠适配器\n仅验证后的原生能力]
    WX[微信适配器 / 模拟入口]
  end
  subgraph LocalOnly[REQ14 独立端侧旁路]
    TD[TextDestructionView\n私有内存缓冲]
    FX[本地销毁动画与资源]
    TD --> FX
  end
  subgraph Edge[Express 接入与安全层]
    HTTP[REST 路由 / DTO 映射]
    SEC[安全 Cookie · CSRF · Origin\n限流 · Zod 严格校验]
  end
  subgraph App[应用层：模块化单体]
    AUTH[AuthService / ProfileService]
    REC[RecordService / RoomService]
    TASK[TaskCoordinator\n双代次与迟到结果拦截]
    AGENT[AgentApplicationService\n任务受理、轮询、取消门面]
    AIP[AIProcessingService\n上下文、安全、响应编排]
  end
  subgraph Domain[领域与策略]
    MODEL[账号 · 会话 · 活动 · 记录\n授权 · 房间 · 寄存]
    POLICY[AuthorizationPolicy / SafetyPolicy]
  end
  subgraph Ports[端口]
    IDR[IdentityRepository]
    RR[RecordRepository]
    ROOM[RoomRepository]
    AIC[AIClient]
    SEARCH[SearchProvider]
  end
  subgraph Infra[基础设施实现]
    PG[(PostgreSQL\n会话、记录、授权、幂等)]
    LC[LangChainModelAdapter]
    SP[固定检索供应商]
  end
  WEB --> HTTP
  ELE --> HTTP
  WX --> HTTP
  WEB -. 页面内独立入口 .-> TD
  ELE -. 本地入口 .-> TD
  WX -. 仅跳转本地独立页 .-> TD
  HTTP --> SEC --> AUTH
  SEC --> REC
  SEC --> TASK
  SEC --> AGENT
  AUTH --> MODEL
  REC --> MODEL
  TASK --> MODEL
  AGENT --> AIP
  AIP --> POLICY
  AUTH --> POLICY
  REC --> POLICY
  AUTH --> IDR
  REC --> RR
  REC --> ROOM
  AIP --> AIC
  AGENT --> SEARCH
  IDR --> PG
  RR --> PG
  ROOM --> PG
  AIC <|.. LC
  LC --> EXT[(受控模型供应商)]
  SEARCH --> SP
  TD -. 禁止连接网络/数据库/模型/搜索/日志/遥测 .- TD
